<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<package>
  <metadata>
    <id>dotnet-typegen</id>
    <version>8.1.0</version>
    <authors>Jacek Burzynski</authors>
    <owners>Jacek Burzynski</owners>
    <license type="file">LICENSE</license>
    <projectUrl>https://github.com/jburzynski/TypeGen</projectUrl>
    <iconUrl>https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jburzynski/type-gen/master/docs/icon.png</iconUrl>
    <requireLicenseAcceptance>false</requireLicenseAcceptance>
    <description>TypeGen .NET CLI tool (TypeGen is a single-class-per-file C# to TypeScript generator)</description>
    <releaseNotes>
- Improved prioritizing assembly paths in AssemblyResolver. Includes fix for the recurring bug where Microsoft / ASP.NET assemblies fail to load.
- Project assembly paths are now prioritized, which should for example eliminate the need to delete old .NET target directories in bin/.
- Errors and warnings are now logged to stderr.
- Inner exceptions are now logged.
- Fixed ConfigProvider.GetDefaultAssemblyPath() throwing CoreException instead of CliException.
- A failure to resolve an assembly in AssemblyResolver is now logged as a warning instead of an error, since generation might be successful even if some of the dependencies are not found.
    </releaseNotes>
    <tags>code-generator generator code typescript ts csharp cs dotnet cli</tags>
    <packageTypes>
      <packageType name="DotnetTool" />
    </packageTypes>
  </metadata>
</package>
